Systems: Types
• Input-Output description: Transfer function that describes only the terminal properties of the system
• Internal or state variable description: A set of differential equations that describes internal as well as terminal behaviors
• Single-input single-output (SISO) system: A system with only one input terminal and only one output terminal
• Multi-input multi-output (MIMO) system: A system with two or more input terminals and two or more output terminals
• Continuous-time system: Continuous-time signals as its input and continuous-time signals as its output
• Discrete-time system: Discrete-time signals as its input and discrete-time signals as its output
